      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Your winglets are in open state, particularly the friends wing on the right. That'll affect the FPS too.\n\nSome amount of FPS drop is expected for the additional draw calls, semi-transparent quick menu, cursor halo effects, and controller movements in VR on top of it.\n\nI don't think this to be any recent regression.",
