      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{68098a4626271974ef4d2775|full_name} While I was playing today, I tried with the winglets closed, got similar results: fps was dropping from 43 to 31\n\nhttps://youtu.be/UmWQ_cyVbX4",
